# API call for register a user

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"ali",
    "email":"ali@gmail.com",
    "password":"pass123",
    "phone_number":"5432987000",
    "address":"",
    "blood_group":"A+",
    "city":"Pala",
    "account_type":"public"
}

# API call for user login

###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"ali",
    "password":"pass123"
}